ck select\n\n2 agent:\n@work-leaf read docs/architecture.md Cargo.toml src/ui.rs src/ui_harness.rs tests/ui_harness.rs tests/terminal_pty.rs src/workspace.rs src/lib.rs\n\n3 user:\nwork-leaf file text\nExact file text is in an orchestrator context bundle instead of this chat to keep the agent session compact.\nContext bundle: /tmp/work-leaf-fair-normal-pilot-runtime-ad016ca/work-leaf/work-leaf-3feature-bench.HiRlMA/context-bundles/orchestrator-1815816-0/bundle-0.md\nYou may read this temporary bundle file for the exact mediated file text. Do not edit the bundle; project writes still require `@work-leaf edit`.\nBundled files:\n- Cargo.toml (fnv64:9f476020ad28b5a2; bytes:454)\n- docs/architecture.md (fnv64:eb3148d3577baccb; bytes:26239)\n- src/lib.rs (fnv64:c769b6d8b6fd5a0b; bytes:1706)\n- src/ui.rs (fnv64:9ee9f02c5bc43f7d; bytes:43323)\n- src/ui_harness.rs (fnv64:770bd2bb00b376ed; bytes:21380)\n- src/workspace.rs (fnv64:001c1f08f5fa26bd; bytes:40263)\n- tests/terminal_pty.rs (fnv64:be39b447c160d1fb; bytes:13125)\n- tests/ui_harness.rs (fnv64:01ef102fdde22996; bytes:15937)\n\n4 agent:\nI have the mediated file bundle now. I’ll inspect only that bundle to understand the current UI state machine and test harness before submitting a focused Work Leaf patch.\n\nThe bundle confirms this is a terminal UI feature, so the relevant code is in `src/ui.rs` plus `src/ui_harness.rs` and `tests/ui_harness.rs`. I’m narrowing on how text is currently rendered and how keyboard bytes are parsed, because visual selection has to share the existing frame path.\n\n@work-leaf read src/terminal_app.rs tests/terminal_ui.rs\n\n5 user:\nwork-leaf file text\nExact file text is in an orchestrator context bundle instead of this chat to keep the agent session compact.\nContext bundle: /tmp/work-leaf-fair-normal-pilot-runtime-ad016ca/work-leaf/work-leaf-3feature-bench.HiRlMA/context-bundles/orchestrator-1815816-0/bundle-3.md\nYou may read this temporary bundle file for the exact mediated file text. 